{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02760",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 3.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.15,
      "end_seconds": 6.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Evening, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 7.74,
      "end_seconds": 10.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.76,
      "end_seconds": 14.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Have you been waiting long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.84,
      "end_seconds": 18.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Mm, only about ten minutes, no trouble."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.57,
      "end_seconds": 21.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 22.55,
      "end_seconds": 31.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.54,
      "text": "It's a chesty cough for a week, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.74,
      "end_seconds": 36.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.48,
      "end_seconds": 46.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "Mm, it's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a round yellow one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.01,
      "end_seconds": 50.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.14,
      "end_seconds": 66.35,
      "duration_seconds": 15.21,
      "text": "For the migraine prevention, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. Ah, I take allopurinol, 100 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.89,
      "end_seconds": 72.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.84,
      "end_seconds": 83.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.58,
      "text": "No, you know, it's at home. It's honey and lemon, at night. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.51,
      "end_seconds": 88.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.43,
      "end_seconds": 95.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "Two months now. I used to take ramipril, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.65,
      "end_seconds": 100.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "So, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.98,
      "end_seconds": 107.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "About... well, four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.5,
      "end_seconds": 120.32,
      "duration_seconds": 11.82,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.68,
      "end_seconds": 127.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "About a five out of ten. I'd say all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.42,
      "end_seconds": 135.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "and, And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 135.41,
      "end_seconds": 141.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Erm, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.28,
      "end_seconds": 157.8,
      "duration_seconds": 15.52,
      "text": "I was getting to that! As for sore throat earlier, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. Oh, and slight aching"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.79,
      "end_seconds": 175.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "have you had any breathlessness or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.29,
      "end_seconds": 180.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "No, no breathlessness or coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.41,
      "end_seconds": 184.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Did you get chest pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.33,
      "end_seconds": 189.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I haven't had chest pain or fever, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.31,
      "end_seconds": 193.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "okay, how are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.77,
      "end_seconds": 196.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.48,
      "end_seconds": 200.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Okay, any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.62,
      "end_seconds": 203.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.82,
      "end_seconds": 210.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Okay, are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.0,
      "end_seconds": 220.89,
      "duration_seconds": 9.89,
      "text": "Sorry, um, what was I saying, not currently, but as a youngster naproxen gave me stomach pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.72,
      "end_seconds": 225.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.18,
      "end_seconds": 228.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "my sister had breast cancer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.44,
      "end_seconds": 233.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.11,
      "end_seconds": 239.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "ah, just a triple bypass, eight years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.51,
      "end_seconds": 242.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "and alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.18,
      "end_seconds": 244.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.25,
      "end_seconds": 247.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.34,
      "end_seconds": 251.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.07,
      "end_seconds": 259.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.23,
      "end_seconds": 264.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.44,
      "end_seconds": 270.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "So, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.42,
      "end_seconds": 295.44,
      "duration_seconds": 21.02,
      "text": "I've had migraines, yes. Yes, gout. I've had high blood pressure, yes. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. I've had heart disease, yes. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.41,
      "end_seconds": 297.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.54,
      "end_seconds": 304.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Okay, I can see migraines and gout in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 306.05,
      "end_seconds": 315.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.48,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. BP is 115 over 79, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, pulse 85. Respiratory rate 15, temp 36.4 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.41,
      "end_seconds": 318.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "good, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.47,
      "end_seconds": 322.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.25,
      "end_seconds": 341.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.75,
      "end_seconds": 345.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.07,
      "end_seconds": 367.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and your oxygen is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.49,
      "end_seconds": 369.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.18,
      "end_seconds": 381.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. So, based on the history and the examination, this is probably acute viral bronchitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 383.06,
      "end_seconds": 387.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "So, you know, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.82,
      "end_seconds": 411.66,
      "duration_seconds": 23.84,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like acute viral bronchitis. Antibiotics will not help; fluids, rest and honey are best and the cough can last three weeks. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 412.56,
      "end_seconds": 414.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.76,
      "end_seconds": 440.21,
      "duration_seconds": 19.45,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if you get a fever or breathlessness, call us the same day or go to emergency. Please come and see me if not better in three weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 440.9,
      "end_seconds": 443.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 444.6,
      "end_seconds": 445.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "all the best"
    }
  ]
}